::notes

Traditionally served with fries and chicory salad. The ingredient list has 1 tablespoon butter; the method uses that tablespoon for the onions and a second spoon for the beef. Both uses are preserved explicitly without silently changing the listed total.

::story

This is a traditional belgian stew made with cheap, though beef cuts, beer and onions. Traditionally eaten with fries and chicory salad.


